+## 2026-10-26 — SDE refresh: an empty map table forces a same-build reload
+
+**Status: IMPLEMENTED + GREEN.** `uv run pytest -q` → **1,089 passed, 7
+deselected**, ruff check + format clean. **Nothing is `LIVE_VALIDATED`; the
+owed live checklist remains unchanged.** Five new offline tests (latest-build
+lookup and download stubbed) landed against the pre-fix code; four of them
+failed before the implementation changed.
+
+- **The build stamp is no longer sole proof the load is complete.** The
+  same-build no-op in `load_sde` now requires every SDE table the load fills
+  — types, market groups, solar systems, stargates, NPC stations — to be
+  actually populated. The deployed symptom: a lake loaded before H1a carried
+  the current build stamp with `sde_stargates` and `sde_npc_stations` empty,
+  the no-op refused to fix it forever, routing answered "current system … is
+  not in the stargate graph" and hauling scans ended `NO_ROUTE` with nothing
+  on the page. A release that adds a table can never silently do that again.
+- **A reload reuses an already-downloaded bundle.** The reload path goes
+  through `download_bundle`, which returns the on-disk
+  `sde-<build>-jsonl.zip` when it is already present and non-empty, so a
+  same-build refill costs no network traffic and nothing is fetched before
+  expiry.
+- **A reload that yields no stargates or no NPC stations fails loudly.** The
+  `SdeError` is raised before `sde_build` advances, so a broken bundle can
+  never be stamped into the trusted no-op path — success over an empty map
+  would have hidden the failure for good. Types and market groups were already
+  guarded, and the all-gates-unresolvable case was; this closes the gap on the
+  two map tables whose emptiness makes every route fail. (An empty
+  `mapSolarSystems.jsonl` still loads but is not stamped over: the table is
+  empty, so the next refresh reloads again instead of reporting a filled
+  lake.)
+
+**+156 lines, −9 across the one product file and its test file** before the
+control-file reconciliation. No formula, detector or verdict rule touched;
+the §23 owed live checklist is unchanged in full.
+
